Always read:
AGENTS.md
MASTER_PROMPT.md
ARCHITECTURE.md

Never generate placeholder code.
Implement one feature at a time.
Explain architecture before coding.

Hard rules:
- Single Next.js app (no apps/admin + apps/web).
- modules/intelligence (not modules/ai).
- Knowledge Engine is the only Supabase domain query layer for travel facts.
- Intelligence never searches the database directly.
- Chat is channel-agnostic (widget → WhatsApp → voice…).
- Renderer converts JSON to UI; Intelligence does not return Markdown UI.
- Design-system owns Royal Rajasthan branding.
